  "summary": "Customers report severe delivery failures, including packages left in insecure locations like doorsteps or roadsides, exposing items to theft [#tk_2974902] [#tk_470776]. Drivers frequently ignore specific instructions, such as leaving parcels with neighbors or in letterboxes, resulting in water damage or loss [#tk_2791958] [#tk_2747237]. Miscommunication regarding signature requirements causes missed deliveries for working customers [#tk_2913200]. Additionally, drivers falsely mark packages as delivered when they are not, or fail to complete same-day orders despite guaranteed times [#tk_2853668] [#tk_2886529] [#tk_451859] [#tk_2061551]."
